{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04769","headline":"送乔安邑备 · 张说","name":"送乔安邑备","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书阁移年岁，文明难复辞。\n欢言冬雪满，恨别夏云滋。\n外尹方爲政，高明自不欺。\n老人骖驭往，童子狎雏嬉。\n日茂西河俗，寂寥东观期。\n遥怀秀才令，京洛见新诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}